(7686079, 1258294, 173844, '<td valign="top">Fine idyllic image, rapt, outdoors, under a tree.  Nicely composed.  Harmonious palette.  A mite heavy on the vignette, just my opinion.  Keep an eye on those beavers.<br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Fine idyllic image, rapt, outdoors, under a tree.  Nicely composed.  Harmonious palette.  A mite heavy on the vignette, just my opinion.  Keep an eye on those beavers.Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2021-02-04 22:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7686080, 1258399, 173844, '<td valign="top">How sweetly these venerable books slip into this becoming still life.  The vase of flowers nicely contrasts with the tattered volumes, visually and metaphorically.  That touch of red is lovely, and perhaps self-referential.  Personally, the watch seems unnecessary, but you won''t see me entering still lifes anywhere close to these beauties, so what do I know?</td>', 'How sweetly these venerable books slip into this becoming still life.  The vase of flowers nicely contrasts with the tattered volumes, visually and metaphorically.  That touch of red is lovely, and perhaps self-referential.  Personally, the watch seems unnecessary, but you won''t see me entering still lifes anywhere close to these beauties, so what do I know?', '2021-02-04 22:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7686082, 1258412, 173844, '<td valign="top">Fine study of concentration.  Black and white works very well, capturing the late hour (guessing this isn''t before dawn).</td>', 'Fine study of concentration.  Black and white works very well, capturing the late hour (guessing this isn''t before dawn).', '2021-02-04 22:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
