(7686117, 1258412, 4008, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by streetpigeon:</b></div><hr/><i> Fine study of concentration.  Black and white works very well, capturing the late hour (guessing this isn''t before dawn). </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Actually in the afternoon, but in a darkened room. Main light source is an e-reader. Some daylight came in and the image was a bit brighter than shown. The antique plate effect added a vignette effect.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by streetpigeon: Fine study of concentration.  Black and white works very well, capturing the late hour (guessing this isn''t before dawn).   Actually in the afternoon, but in a darkened room. Main light source is an e-reader. Some daylight came in and the image was a bit brighter than shown. The antique plate effect added a vignette effect. ', '2021-02-05 03:26:59.000000', NULL, 0),
