(7686123, 1258431, 3306, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by LevT:</b></div><hr/><i> Congrats on your ribbon, well done! Wait, your fist looks bigger than the hole! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I walked around for 2 days after I took this shot trying to figure out how to get the book off my arm!</td>', 'Originally posted by LevT: Congrats on your ribbon, well done! Wait, your fist looks bigger than the hole!   I walked around for 2 days after I took this shot trying to figure out how to get the book off my arm!', '2021-02-05 05:35:26.000000', NULL, 0),
